# Recommended by graphify (README → Troubleshooting): its outputs change on every
# rebuild. NOTE: Claude Code does not read .claudeignore — it is not an official
# feature (anthropics/claude-code#29455). It only takes effect with a hook such as
# li-zhixin/claude-ignore; the built-in equivalent is `permissions.deny` in
# .claude/settings.json.
